    <bpmn:process id="W_W4268" name="W4268. Driver/3PL COD Authorization, Bonding &amp; Contract Terms" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: 3PL contracting (VS-56); own-crew onboarding; loss/audit finding
Frequency: Per contract + onboarding
Volume: All drivers/3PLs authorized to collect COD cash
Owner: Procurement (VS-34) / Payment Ops / Last-Mile (VS-06.3/VS-56)
Participants: Legal (VS-100.3), Finance (VS-17.4), HR (VS-98 for own crew), Insurance (VS-26), Fraud (VS-125)
Source: workflow W4268 — Driver/3PL COD Authorization, Bonding &amp; Contract Terms</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4268_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4268_Lane1" name="Procurement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4268_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4268_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4268_Lane2" name="Payment Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4268_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4268_Lane3" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4268_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4268_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4268_Start5" name="3PL contracting (VS-56); own-crew onboarding; loss/audit finding">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4268_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4268_Task6" name="Procurement/Legal embed COD cash-handling terms in 3PL contracts (cash custody…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Procurement/Legal embed COD cash-handling terms in 3PL contracts (cash custody responsibility, remittance SLA, bonding/security deposit, liability for loss/theft, audit rights) and in own-crew terms (coordinate VS-98)
Responsible (R): Procurement / Legal / Last-Mile
Accountable (A): CFO / COO
Duration: Per contract</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4268_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4268_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4268_Task7" name="Payment Ops/Last-Mile authorize specific drivers/crews to collect COD (ID…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Payment Ops/Last-Mile authorize specific drivers/crews to collect COD (ID, training on W4270 controls, fidelity bonding, daily cash limit per driver), and revoke on breach
Responsible (R): Payment Ops / Last-Mile / HR
Accountable (A): Head of Payment Ops
Duration: Per driver</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4268_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4268_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4268_Task8" name="Finance/Insurance structure bonding/insurance coverage (fidelity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/Insurance structure bonding/insurance coverage (fidelity, cash-in-transit for the inward chain) via VS-26, and track exposure vs bonded limits
Responsible (R): Finance / Insurance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4268_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4268_End9" name="Complete">
