        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-656 (ensure controlled execution — COD Program Design, Policy &amp; Risk Framework (PA-142.1).) | - CTL-656: drivers authorized, trained (W4270) &amp; bonded; contract liability explicit; insurance in place (VS-26)
Owner: Procurement (VS-34) / Payment Ops / Last-Mile (VS-06.3/VS-56)</bpmn:text>
