      <bpmn:userTask id="W4269_Task6" name="Risk/Payment Ops identify COD risks (driver theft, customer refusal/short-pay…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Risk/Payment Ops identify COD risks (driver theft, customer refusal/short-pay, robbery in transit, fraud/phantom order, float/working-capital) and define mitigation/limits per risk, integrated to ERM (VS-21.2)
Responsible (R): Risk / Payment Ops
Accountable (A): Head of Payment Ops / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4269_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4269_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4269_Task7" name="Treasury/Finance define the COD float/working-capital policy (cash-in-motion…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Treasury/Finance define the COD float/working-capital policy (cash-in-motion accounting, aging of unremitted COD, provisioning for refusal/loss) and the loss-account/treatment (write-off thresholds, recovery via VS-26/VS-90)
Responsible (R): Treasury / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4269_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4269_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
