        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Insurance/Risk structure coverage (fidelity, cash-in-transit, robbery) via VS-26, define loss-reporting thresholds/escalation, and feed the risk register (VS-21.2)
Responsible (R): Insurance / Risk
Accountable (A): CFO / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4269_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4269_End9" name="Complete">
