      <bpmn:userTask id="W4270_Task5" name="Payment Ops/Audit define the COD cash-handling standard (exact-change policy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Payment Ops/Audit define the COD cash-handling standard (exact-change policy, receipt/POD capture, dual-control where feasible, daily remittance limit, tamper-evident bag, no-cash-overnight rule), with segregation of duties (collector ≠ reconciler ≠ poster)
Responsible (R): Payment Ops / Audit
Accountable (A): Head of Payment Ops
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4270_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4270_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4270_Task6" name="Payment Ops train drivers/3PL/own crew on the standard (coordinate W4268…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Payment Ops train drivers/3PL/own crew on the standard (coordinate W4268 authorization &amp; VS-98), and embed proof capture (POD + cash amount photo/digital) into the delivery app (VS-06.3)
Responsible (R): Payment Ops / Last-Mile / HR
Accountable (A): Head of Payment Ops
Duration: Per onboarding</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4270_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4270_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4270_Task7" name="Audit/Fraud monitor adherence (exception reports, spot checks, exception-based…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Audit/Fraud monitor adherence (exception reports, spot checks, exception-based analytics VS-23/VS-125), investigate deviations, and enforce consequence
Responsible (R): Audit / Fraud / Payment Ops
Accountable (A): Head of Payment Ops / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4270_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4270_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4270_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
