      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4271_Task6" name="Tax/Compliance define the BIR treatment of COD sales (revenue recognition at…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Tax/Compliance define the BIR treatment of COD sales (revenue recognition at delivery/collection, VAT per VS-79, official receipt/serial POS-equivalent for cash sales, cash-receipting compliance)
Responsible (R): Tax / Compliance
Accountable (A): CFO / VP Legal
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4271_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4271_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4271_Task7" name="Treasury/AML define large-cash / structuring thresholds and any AML/CTR…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Treasury/AML define large-cash / structuring thresholds and any AML/CTR consideration for high-value COD cash inflows (coordinate VS-86/AMLC, VS-18)
Responsible (R): Treasury / AML / Compliance
Accountable (A): CFO / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4271_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4271_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4271_Task8" name="Compliance/Legal document the framework, lodge any cash-handling/reporting…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Compliance/Legal document the framework, lodge any cash-handling/reporting requirements (VS-22), and schedule periodic compliance review/audit (VS-21)
Responsible (R): Compliance / Legal / Audit
Accountable (A): VP Legal / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4271_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
