        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Payment Ops/EA/IT design the COD data/integration architecture (order ↔ delivery/POD ↔ cash-collected ↔ remittance ↔ settlement ↔ GL), the cash-status ledger per order, and the 3PL data exchange (VS-56)
