        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: IT/Ecommerce implement &amp; integrate (delivery app cash-capture VS-06.3, 3PL cash file, bank deposit feed VS-18, GL auto-posting VS-17.1, fraud rules VS-125), and govern data quality
Responsible (R): IT / Ecommerce / Payment Ops
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Per deployment</bpmn:documentation>
